{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1000_p", "source_sha256": "933695524378907dbec75da28ad2a6a1827c6bf075bc40069fead2aa92f8c439", "ja": "（育が主演をつとめるドラマの撮影がいよいよ始まる。\nスタジオの準備は着々と進んでいるが……）", "zh": "（育主演的电视剧终于要开始拍摄了。\n摄影棚的准备工作正有条不紊地进行着，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a05800d41b1a09837b71d1875d04674e57c0d3e01342553eb8b8971a830201f7", "ja": "……。\n何か、物陰から視線を感じる……はっ？", "zh": "……。\n总觉得暗处有人在盯着看……哈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "2b001e0083d861408546fa37acfd7ef9dfcfcaa4a6b779c9e60f046f769b420f", "ja": "じーっ……。", "zh": "（盯）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fc30f937572d8d212e4bd9bfc6c3ca92c3020dd0325bda1849d5c96f1a7a8cf5", "ja": "……。どうしたんだ？　育。\nさっきから、こっちを覗いて。", "zh": "……。怎么了吗，育？\n从刚才起就一直在偷看我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "b6cf6397fe9720a86162c5c332aef2b978f03657ea18b0860a468e5417841978", "ja": "あっ、見つかっちゃった。\n{$P$}さん、どうしてわかったの？", "zh": "啊，被发现了。\n{$P$}先生，你怎么知道的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1005_p", "source_sha256": "32670e1d9771e1c7cbf371638a65d892a550a0bb3e83c7614e803bf918a00ebd", "ja": "気配がしたから見てみたら、目が合ったんだ。\nもしかして、ずっとそこに隠れてたのか？", "zh": "感觉到动静后我就看了一下，结果和你对上眼了。\n难道你一直躲在那里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "4f38d415901d186456b1bb2fc94eaa968eedfec8ec32353fbffc903504b78790", "ja": "ううん。わたし、{$P$}さんの後ろに\n隠れて、ついていってたんだよ。しってた？", "zh": "不是哦。我是一直藏在{$P$}先生身后，\n跟着你走过来的哦。你不知道吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1007_p", "source_sha256": "10e499b1e6cf0f94d95eb238080215616eb1ca2e0956fef8aaeeb1703362f840", "ja": "えっ！？　それは気づかなかったな……。", "zh": "诶！？我都没注意到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "b08c12ce0d59ecb156159ac66baf9fd02a6703863133360612fd8e43315a1ff0", "ja": "朝スタジオで着替えてからずっと、\n{$P$}さんをかんさつしてたの！", "zh": "从早上在工作室换好衣服之后，\n我就一直在观察{$P$}先生了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "1828e7f01b21b576c60f582a70013058ebf1513aecfe2f835173d3dadfbffad8", "ja": "ほら。探偵も怪人役も、隠れて尾行する場面が\nあるでしょ？　だから練習しとかなきゃって。", "zh": "你看。无论是侦探还是怪人，都有躲起来跟踪的场景吧？所以得提前练习才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9cf397336d34e588af1802ffeaa662435c4c1620e80bda38ba24d536cd4ab0a1", "ja": "なるほど、役作りのためにか。\n熱心にやってくれて、ありがとな。", "zh": "原来如此，是为了塑造角色啊。谢谢你这么用心地练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "f97e7a6baffc7cb30467acb66158b5992fa91d082512e2d9e724a83ac75dcba0", "ja": "えへへ。前に桃子ちゃんが、うまく演技したかったら\n本当にやってみるのもいいよって教えてくれたんだ。", "zh": "嘿嘿。之前桃子告诉我，要是想演好戏，亲自试试看也是不错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1012_p", "source_sha256": "50b4cc6bd8fc552fd82b91987af077f3d1a17fcaec06ec939c7b4b91277fbb20", "ja": "そうか、さすが桃子、いいアドバイス……。\n……って、待てよ？　着替えてからずっと……？", "zh": "这样啊，不愧是桃子，真是个好建议……\n……等等，难道从换好衣服之后一直……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "62a137bd3ff46bb8ad89cd1115f5723a299104e57d3287819cdb0e64269ff440", "ja": "うん！　いつバレるかなって\nドキドキしてたんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯！我一直在紧张，不知道什么时候会被发现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "77849c6d4241a6984376993624ffa5dcad09ae95e71cf7ac145de223234a784e", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、スタジオのすみっこで\n身だしなみを整えたりするんだね。見ちゃった。", "zh": "{$P$}先生原来会在演播室的角落里\n整理仪容呢。我看到了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7918cec0c2f2cf56fd4ce1636dc9b19578d89e7021c35d0c129d385ef58e50ce", "ja": "そ、そうだな。見られてたか……ええと。\nあれは、打ち合わせの前だったから……。", "zh": "是、是啊。被看到了啊……呃。  \n那是在开会前，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "81592b901430dca311ded35753f2b20a2bf1a97ed3d3d23c146f0edf7a191818", "ja": "それに、すっごくおおきなあくびしてた！\nふわああー！って。", "zh": "而且还打了个超级大的哈欠！\n“呼啊啊——！”那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1017_p", "source_sha256": "8ed6f32643d306d5a74474e5a6a0caf4fbda05b406c7b5914fac0d2d4cd33fa1", "ja": "うっ、そんなところまで……！", "zh": "呃，连那种地方都……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "89fea971d60090be19f4de1dd1dabfccb8bce65c055da994198c7778e2f4a891", "ja": "でも、きのうも夜遅くまでお仕事がんばってたから\nあくびがでたんだよね？　わたしは、そう推理したの。", "zh": "不过，你昨晚也努力工作到很晚，所以才打哈欠的吧？我就是这么推理的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7a00dc2fe67d88e707e19e72348a34672b20471071592ac9c01e6c93f4f2bc24", "ja": "おっと……。尾行だけじゃなくて、推理も完璧みたい\nだな。これは、本番が楽しみだ！", "zh": "哎呀……看来不只是跟踪，连推理也完美无缺啊。  \n这下真期待正式演出了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "dee650e04b136624bb74e03de7f8ed1c75c4dff7ebe1ead7dfb65b91969ff52a", "ja": "えへへ……ありがとう、{$P$}さん。\nいつもわたしたちのために、がんばってくれて。", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢你，{$P$}先生。\n一直以来都在为我们努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0234_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "7690cf4d19201e5fd3407a7109f99baa6bd5978d0105d627d36009d41f01e610", "ja": "お返しに、わたしもちゃんとがんばるから。\n撮影、しっかり見ててね！", "zh": "作为回礼，我也会好好努力的。\n拍摄时要认真看着我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
